  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating SDGs through Localization in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Constitution of Kenya 2010 and the Public Finance Management Act 2012 embed public participation (PP) in Kenya&#x2019;s development process. Various platforms for public participation exist but citizen voices are missing or underdeveloped, due to inadequate resources, lack of political will and retrogressive cultural attitudes. This has slowed implementation of SDGs at the county level. 17 counties 17 counties (Kakamega, Vihiga, Elgeyo Marakwet, Bungoma, Kajiado, Narok, Taita Taveta, Homa Bay, West</narrative>
  </description>
